\newlabel{fig_mosaic}{{2}{12}{\textbf {Context-aware prediction mosaic.} Each panel shows students with identical response sequences (green/red bars for correct/incorrect responses) but different learning situations. BKT predictions (dotted grey) overlap due to Markovian constraints; gTransformer predictions (solid coloured) diverge based on historical parameters ($p_{\text {L}_0}$, $p_{\text {T}}$). Circles indicate predicted correct responses; crosses indicate predicted failures}{figure.1.2}{}}
